# HTTP examples for module 14-testing. Run them from IntelliJ IDEA / VS Code (REST Client).
# The lesson of this module is its test suite: ./mvnw -pl modules/14-testing/lesson verify
# The application itself calls a payment service at PAYMENT_URL (default http://localhost:9090), which does not
# exist locally — so a valid order answers 500 here. That is exactly why the tests mock PaymentClient.

### 400 — validation fails before the service is called
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"isbn": "", "quantity": 0}

### 404 — unknown book (answered before the payment service is needed)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"isbn": "0000000000000", "quantity": 1}

### 409 — not enough stock (Java Puzzlers is sold out)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"isbn": "9780321336781", "quantity": 1}
